  "_comment": "Region definitions for the OSM-only build (spec §6). Each region maps to one dist/regions/<region>.pmtiles. Adding a country is a config row: `geofabrik_extract` is the Geofabrik path (no `-latest.osm.pbf` suffix — the downloader adds it), `region_trust` (high|medium) feeds §4.1's +5 region signal, `countries` are ISO codes for attribution. Everything is sourced from OpenStreetMap (ODbL) — trails, areas, the hiking-route official signal, and the inside-a-protected-area whitelist (from OSM area polygons) — so `sources` is [\"osm\"] and the fail-closed licensing gate always passes. `curation_mode`: baked (apply the high+medium threshold at build time) | shipped_filter (tile all, curate on-device). `region_trust` is a coarse OSM-maturity bucket.",
